{"version":1,"content":"<p>歌手吳若希（Jinny）於10月中「淡出」處境劇《愛．回家之三代同糖》後，其歷時逾1個月的長假終結束，昨晚（22號）她演出重慶大劇院舉行的《飲歌—香港影視流行音樂會（重慶站）》，現場獻唱無綫劇《使徒行者》插曲《越難越愛》，引發全場觀眾大合唱</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T05:50:39.273870+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T05:07:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T05:44:03.827081+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T05:44:03.827081+00:00","content_hash":"b8a9876cbc449ce1716da742be3a16d2f751aab460aeef3d78cebe60b1835f65","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}